# Zolly office runtime — machine-local state, NOT memory.
#
# Founder decision, 2026-10-22: the office layer stays OFF this repo. This
# repo is PUBLIC, and the office layer carries the founder's working
# preferences and personal notes. It is not published.
#
# .agents/results/ is deliberately NOT ignored: a worker commits its result
# file on the task branch, and the reviewer reads it there. It is not
# committed to main, but git has no per-branch ignore.
#
# The cost, accepted knowingly: a fresh clone and every task worktree carry
# no rules, so an agent there re-derives them. The office only runs on the
# machine that holds .agents/.
.agents/AGENTS.md
.agents/foreman/
.agents/hr/
.agents/memory/
.agents/prompts/
.agents/reviewer/
.agents/rules/
.agents/shared/
.agents/worker/
.agents/zolly/
.agents/STATE.md
.agents/day.json
.agents/queue/
.agents/runs/
.agents/inbox/
.agents/worktrees/
.agents/trash/
.agents/days/
.agents/events/
.agents/monitor/
.agents/memory/.work/
.agents/memory/.lock
.agents/memory/*.tmp
.agents-backup-*/
.agents/foreman.pid
.agents/foreman-loop.pid
.agents/foreman-settle.pid
.agents/LAST_PROMPT.md
.agents/foreman-nudged.stamp
.agents/zolly/telegram_offset.txt
.agents/zolly/telegram_serve.lock
.agents/zolly/task_ledger.json
.agents/zolly/task_ledger.json.tmp
.agents/zolly/dead_letter.jsonl
.agents/nudge.stamp

